<title>JAPAN: Odakyu Railway - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Odakyu Railway - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 81.36		vs	   79.06</p>
<p> Operating	   17.72		vs	   15.11</p>
<p> Current		8.69		vs	    7.23</p>
<p> Net		    2.50		vs	    2.20</p>
<p> EPS		    3.45 yen	  vs	    3.09 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     732 million	 vs	  711 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Odakyu Electric Railway Co Ltd operates the Shinjuku-Hakone line.</p>
</text>
